# The four-step wifi ramp is byte-identical to the one in config/waybar/config,
# and deliberately so: the bar's glyph and this panel's row for the same network
# must never disagree about how strong the signal is. Percentage buckets are
# therefore also the same -- 4 icons over 0-100, i.e. [0-24] [25-49] [50-74]
# [75-100].
#
# KNOWN WEAK, MEASURED, AND KEPT ANYWAY -- do not "fix" it by growing the icon.
# These four Material glyphs are one cone of identical ink bounds whose hollow
# top arc shrinks as strength rises, so neighbouring levels differ by very
# little. Rendered from the real face and diffed:
#
#     size 15px   ink 71/81/91/102 px   adjacent-level differences 17, 16, 30
#     size 21px   ink 127/146/168/194   adjacent-level differences 26, 28, 51
